 R←Test_Misc_010(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;CR;LF;header;body
⍝ Exercise `DropBody`
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 (CR LF)←⎕UCS 13 10
 header←'POST /a HTTP/1.1',CR,LF,'Content-Length: 4',CR,LF,CR,LF
 body←'a=12'
 →T.PassesIf header≡##.Plodder.DropBody header,body
 →T.PassesIf header≡##.Plodder.DropBody header
 →T.PassesIf('POST /a HTTP/1.1',LF,LF)≡##.Plodder.DropBody'POST /a HTTP/1.1',LF,LF,body
 →T.PassesIf(¯4↓header)≡##.Plodder.DropBody ¯4↓header      ⍝ Header not complete yet
 →T.PassesIf''≡##.Plodder.DropBody body                     ⍝ A block from the middle of a body
 →T.PassesIf''≡##.Plodder.DropBody''

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
